From 286dab7d213601220282d8f0dac652c98946c138 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Biomni <biomni@local>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:48:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Zeta-Core v4 PSA audit correction and closure diagnostics

Implements schema-based refusal validation, Contract A RUO release, explicit three-observation sign handling, D9 survival-metric equivalence, closure-grade D10-D12 diagnostics, and strict report/manifest verification. Excludes the unrelated Cohere test-harness repair. Absolute-risk and treatment outputs remain disabled; categorical band remains suppressed.
